@startuml FRQ-PTN-18.1-resource-sequence
' Praćenje resursa workflowa — prijedlog.
' Gledište: izvedba. Publika: implementator, operater.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13) — izvor su HLRQ-18 BR-01…BR-08 i FRQ-PTN-18.1 §5–§6.
' ResourceManager je provizorno ime (autor, 2026-09-11); manageri konekcija, drivera i procesora
' su zatečeni. Proširenje za GPU živi u blackwattle i uvozi se odgođeno.
title FRQ-PTN-18.1 — resource awareness: limits at build, samples at unit-of-work boundaries

autonumber
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center

participant "WorkflowFactory" as WF
participant "rm :\nResourceManager\n<<proposed>>" as RM
participant "platform\n(cgroup, procfs, sysconf,\ndisk usage, affinity)" as OS
participant "GPU extension\n(blackwattle)\n<<optional>>" as GPU
participant "p :\nprocessor" as P
participant "bb :\nblackboard" as BB
participant "audit record" as AUD

WF -> RM : ResourceManager(thresholds per resource, storage paths)
activate RM
RM -> OS : RAM limit — container memory.max, else host
RM -> OS : CPU limit — container cpu.max, else affinity
RM -> OS : storage — free space and inodes per write path
alt GPU extension installed
  RM -> GPU : device memory limit
else
  RM -> RM : GPU = not measured (BR-08)
end
note right of RM
  narrowest source first (BR-01);
  each source recorded; unknown stays
  "unknown", never guessed
end note
deactivate RM

P -> RM : pass started (EV02)
RM -> OS : baselines
loop per document (unit of work)
  P -> BB : create → pipelines → flush
  P -> RM : cycle completed (EV03)
  activate RM
  RM -> OS : RSS, CPU throttling, CPU time, free storage
  opt GPU extension installed
    RM -> GPU : device memory used
  end
  alt threshold crossed or bottleneck visible (EV04)
    RM -> AUD : WARNING at once — resource, limit source,\nplace in flow; once per crossing
    note right of RM
      no stop: warning only
      (author, 2026-09-11; BR-04)
    end note
  end
  deactivate RM
end
P -> RM : pass completed (EV05)
RM -> AUD : summary once per pass, per resource:\nlimit and source, baseline, peak, share, crossings

note over P, BB #FFCDD2
  The processor still references the last document until the generator has
  created the next one, so the memory peak is about two documents even after
  flush (HLRQ-18 §7 t.4, BR-06).
end note
@enduml
